Check 2: what the MSSQL state values mean

timeseries st = avg(`sql-server.databases.state`, scalar: true), by:{database.state}, from:-2h
| summarize series = count(), minValue = min(st), maxValue = max(st), by:{database.state}


This shows whether the value is just a code and database.state is the real signal.

